      section_prose(content: "**◆ Milestones:** key-by-construction ✓ (#5425) → **▸ warm==cold purity proven (616/616, #5429)** → resolve-cache ON — ~18% floor cut *(core ask)* → native `content(T)` *(gated B2)*"),
      section_group(
        label: "",
        nodes: [
          derivable(id: "2-f1", prs: [5421], title: "F1 scheduler gives heavy nodes budgeted width", description: ""),
          derivable(id: "2-f2f3", prs: [5425], title: "F2/F3 `resolved_graph` key derived from declared `inputs_considered`", description: "— construction, not a lens"),
          authored(id: "2-p1", done: true, content: "P1 honest keys by construction — warm==cold purity oracle **LANDED (#5429)**"),
          authored(id: "2-p2", done: false, content: "P2 one door: `realize(subject)` sole API — kernel inhabits `cache_interface.dag` (#5446); ParseTable dissolution is downstream of the dsl→v2 de-fork (§5)"),
          plain(id: "2-hermetic", content: "hermetic fixtures feed P2: [x] M4.1 universal hermetic corpus governance (#5236, [plan](docs/plans/m4-universal-hermetic-corpus.md)); [ ] M5 fixture-store onto one Realization kernel ([plan](docs/plans/m5-fixture-store-consolidation.md))"),
          authored(id: "2-p3", done: false, content: "P3 **resolve-cache enable** — purity proven (616/616); cache is correct but **opt-in** (`GUNBC_RESOLVED_GRAPH_CACHE_DIR`): #5789's always-on `$TMPDIR` default was reverted because the whole-file JSON read (hit) and write (miss) buffer ~11x the packed graph in memory and OOM the concurrent-shard floor. Re-enabling by default is gated on a streaming IO realization (binary + `deserialize_from`/`serialize_into`, no whole-file `Vec<u8>`)"),
          authored(id: "2-p4", done: false, content: "P4 economic tier (measured cost → `Materialization`) — instrument done (#5431); remaining = (a) space arm: per-shard RSS plumbing → `CostEstimate.space` on `Runnable` (nodes A+B, [plan](docs/plans/resource-aware-scheduler.md)); (b) time arm: consumer feedback → `CostAccount.time = Measured` feeds width-fold (node C+D); dissolves `cost_account_predicted_zero()` on the floor path"),
          authored(id: "2-p5", done: false, content: "P5 native `content(T) = content_hash(subgraph)` — gated on B2"),
